## Detection Engineering Concept

A basic behavioral rule:

IF user_role = customer_service_or_sales
AND records_accessed > historical_baseline * 5
AND data_scope = multiple_regions_or_customer_segments
THEN
severity = HIGH
require_step_up_authentication
suspend_bulk_export
alert_security_team

A stronger detection model would baseline activity per:

* identity,
* department,
* job role,
* geography,
* application,
* customer segment,
* API operation,
* query size,
* export volume,
* time of day.

