## Attack Breakers

Controls capable of reducing either breach probability or blast radius include:

* phishing-resistant MFA
* Conditional Access
* device compliance
* strong MFA recovery controls
* JIT privileged access
* PAM
* role-based access control
* field-level authorization
* bulk-export restrictions
* DLP
* behavioral analytics
* data minimization
* short retention periods
* sensitive-field tokenization
* database auditing
* cloud audit logging
* session-risk detection
* segmentation between corporate and operational systems
* automatic credential rotation
* OAuth/app governance

